  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing soil health  provision of ecosystem services by soils through RECSOIL and Soil Doctors</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The outcome of this project will be the strengthening of national and regional capacities in sustainable soil management and its effective implementation on the ground via the RECSOIL, and in the generation and use of soil information for better decision-making. This will contribute to achieving the overall objectives of the mandate and mission of the Global Soil Partnership.</narrative>
  </description>
